ll, "curation_sha256": "3a73172478b35e7f27656ab26428f93be1ce9a617c9772e36fff8a72564a2884", "decisions_sha256": null, "evidence_build_id": "e5d1ff4e390aab4b3a6055a7a32e3ec785db1c4eaf79b9369c89548d5a72b1ce", "pack_id": "NUPA-ISTP-2026-014+ADD-03-CANDIDATE", "readings_sha256": "09d13a4d76d1f94a63286feda57333c6c2b5aa5388e9f7516103024ac9a38be7", "register_sha256": "7f7fa1b15632133b0e2e1a52f97887f4be357e56287a236085431e9c1281d3b1", "relationships_sha256": "653db1deb98f2206e8388f488582235916fe1a63ea46294131413bc4263946fe", "unrecorded_crops_sha256": null, "validated_stage": "ADD-02", "working_stage": "ADD-03"}, "statement_type": "disposition"}, {"dependencies": ["ADD-03:p3-image/r2", "ADD-03:T8-1/2", "ADD-03:2.2", "ADD-03:Q16"], "evidence": [{"crop_sha256": "c3cd62470d6bb87e308374d434c36c3be8f58b7e3c2057472583c7160a0e36d4", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 3, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p3-image/r2", "words": "مدة الإصدار (أيام عمل): ٥"}, {"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:T8-1/2", "words": "Issue period (Working Days): 3"}, {"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 1, "unit_id": "ADD-03:2.2", "words": "The Arabic text governs. The English translation at Appendix B is provided for convenience only."}, {"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 2, "unit_id": "ADD-03:Q16", "words": "the issue period in row 2 of Table 8-1 is reduced by two (2) Working Days"}], "id": "I-r2-discrepancy", "model_rationale": "Viewed r02.png and the full region crop: the row 2 period cell shows ٥, distinct from the ٣ in row 1.", "payload": {"owner": "Legal", "short": "Table 8-1 row 2 issue period: Arabic ٥ vs English 3", "text": "ambiguous: Table 8-1 row 2 (company incorporated outside the GCC states) prints two different issue periods. The Arabic original (Appendix A, image reading pending approval) reads 'مدة الإصدار (أيام عمل): ٥' (5 Working Days). The English translation (Appendix B, ADD-03:T8-1/2) reads 'Issue period (Working Days): 3'. Section 2.2 states 'The Arabic text governs. The English translation at Appendix B is provided for convenience only.' Q16 states 'the issue period in row 2 of Table 8-1 is reduced by two (2) Working Days' for an application lodged not later than Sunday 22 November 2026. Reading A: the base row 2 period is 5 (Arabic), so the reduced period is computed from 5. Reading B: the translation's 3 reflects the period after the Q16 reduction, or is an error; if 3 were taken as the base, the reduction would apply to 3. The period used for programme planning (A5) and for Clause 8.9/2.3 depends on this. Whether 2.2 settles it, and which figure applies, is a person's decision (Legal). The reading of the digit ٥ also awaits approval (Document control).", "theme": "Arabic/English discrepancy"}, "provision": "ADD-03:p3-image/r2", "state": {"activity_templates_sha256": "8f720c1d04e5f6d1926872e7bdeca2e28537782912cdc237796e2fe98e30d005", "amendments_sha256": "3edcf917cfc134e6f46c5e95e8b0f9c45b18dd217d59e0c837d695d96aa5fa91", "assumptions_sha256": "1be8633a5dbbfbee53f7637e0fe9f82ab864f0adf635993ad4d69bac9f45ce4d", "base_candidate_sha256": null, "base_run": null, "curation_sha256": "3a73172478b35e7f27656ab26428f93be1ce9a617c9772e36fff8a72564a2884", "decisions_sha256": null, "evidence_build_id": "e5d1ff4e390aab4b3a6055a7a32e3ec785db1c4eaf79b9369c89548d5a72b1ce", "pack_id": "NUPA-ISTP-2026-014+ADD-03-CANDIDATE", "readings_sha256": "09d13a4d76d1f94a63286feda57333c6c2b5aa5388e9f7516103024ac9a38be7", "register_sha256": "7f7fa1b15632133b0e2e1a52f97887f4be357e56287a236085431e9c1281d3b1", "relationships_sha256": "653db1deb98f2206e8388f488582235916fe1a63ea46294131413bc4263946fe", "unrecorded_crops_sha256": null, "validated_stage": "ADD-02", "working_stage": "ADD-03"}, "statement_type": "issue", "statements": ["S-F1", "S-F2", "S-F3", "S-F4"], "target": "ADD-03:p3-image/r2"}, {"dependencies": ["I-r2-discrepancy"], "evidence": [{"crop_sha256": "c3cd62470d6bb87e308374d434c36c3be8f58b7e3c2057472583c7160a0e36d4", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 3, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p3-image/r2", "words": "مدة الإصدار (أيام عمل): ٥"}, {"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:T8-1/2", "words": "Issue period (Working Days): 3"}], "id": "Q-r2-period", "payload": {"decision_owner": "Bid management", "gap": "Table 8-1 row 2: the Arabic original prints '٥' Working Days, but the English translation at Appendix B prints 'Issue period (Working Days): 3'. Q16 reduces the row 2 period 'by two (2) Working Days' for applications lodged by 22 November 2026.", "interim_handling": "Plan on the longer Arabic period until a person decides; do not apply the Q16 reduction to the translation's figure.", "practical_impact": "Sets the lead time for obtaining a Certificate of Investment Registration for a non-GCC member, and therefore when the application must be lodged before Envelope A.", "proposed_question": "DRAFT: Please confirm the issue period for row 2 of Table 8-1 (company incorporated outside the GCC states). The Arabic text at Appendix A shows five (٥) Working Days; the English translation at Appendix B shows three (3). Please also confirm the period that applies, after the reduction stated in the response to Q16, to an application lodged not later than Sunday 22 November 2026."}, "provision": "ADD-03:p3-image/r2", "state": {"activity_templates_sha256": "8f720c1d04e5f6d1926872e7bdeca2e28537782912cdc237796e2fe98e30d005", "amendments_sha256": "3edcf917cfc134e6f46c5e95e8b0f9c45b18dd217d59e0c837d695d96aa5fa91", "assumptions_sha256": "1be8633a5dbbfbee53f7637e0fe9f82ab864f0adf635993ad4d69bac9f45ce4d", "base_candidate_sha256": null, "base_run": null, "curation_sha256": "3a73172478b35e7f27656ab26428f93be1ce9a617c9772e36fff8a72564a2884", "decisions_sha256": null, "evidence_build_id": "e5d1ff4e390aab4b3a6055a7a32e3ec785db1c4eaf79b9369c89548d5a72b1ce", "pack_id": "NUPA-ISTP-2026-014+ADD-03-CANDIDATE", "readings_sha256": "09d13a4d76d1f94a63286feda57333c6c2b5aa5388e9f7516103024ac9a38be7", "regist