ic Table 8-1 row 2 issue period cell reads ٥ (image reading, pending approval)."}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:T8-1/2", "words": "Issue period (Working Days): 3"}], "id": "S-F3", "kind": "fact", "text": "The English translation at Appendix B, row 2, prints an issue period of 3 Working Days."}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 2, "unit_id": "ADD-03:Q16", "words": "the issue period in row 2 of Table 8-1 is reduced by two (2) Working Days"}], "id": "S-F4", "kind": "fact", "text": "Q16 states a two Working Day reduction of the row 2 issue period for an application lodged not later than Sunday 22 November 2026."}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 1, "unit_id": "ADD-03:2.2", "words": "Table 8-1 is reproduced at Appendix A to this Addendum as issued by the Office and forms part of Volume I."}], "id": "S-I1", "kind": "interpretation", "text": "The Appendix A units (the Office's letter and the Arabic Table 8-1 rows and notes) are the content of the table that Clause 2.2 makes part of Volume I; that incorporation is the op for ADD-03:2.2 (another batch). The Appendix A units themselves amend no unit of the volumes."}]}, "run_id": "ADD-03-host-20261008T060042Z-c2e0", "ts": "2026-10-08T06:00:42Z"}
